    >
      <h2
        class="_sectionHeader_c6a955"
      >
        Summary
      </h2>
      <p>
        Sr. Software Engineering Manager with 10+ years of experience, promoted 4 times at Teladoc Health from Associate Engineer to Sr. Manager. Scaled an engineering org from 3 to 18+, led teams through ~80x traffic growth, and delivered an $18M annualized revenue lift from a registration redesign. Champion of AI-augmented engineering (Claude Code, Copilot, Rovo) to raise team velocity and code quality.

      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="_section_c6a955"
    >
      <h2
        class="_sectionHeader_c6a955"
      >
        Experience
      </h2>
      <div
        class="_experience_c6a955"
      >
        <div
          class="_experienceRow_c6a955"
        >
          <span>
            Teladoc Health
          </span>
        </div>
        <p
          class="_experienceNote_c6a955"
        >
          Promoted 4 times in 8 years, from Associate Software Engineer to Sr. Manager.
        </p>
        <div
          class="_titleBlock_c6a955"
        >
          <div
            class="_experienceRow_c6a955"
          >
            <span>
              Sr. Manager, Software Engineering
            </span>
            <span
              class="_experienceDates_c6a955"
            >
              03/2026 – Present
            </span>
          </div>
          <ul
            class="_accomplishmentList_c6a955"
          >
            <li>
              Lead an 18+ person engineering org across multiple product areas: 10 direct reports (2 engineering managers and 8 engineers) plus their teams. Own architecture, delivery, and roadmap trade-offs; mentor managers and senior engineers; partner with Product and Business to align technology decisions to outcomes.
            </li>
            <li>
              Led implementation and launch of the redesigned Teladoc Health user registration experience, increasing conversion 12% (+$18M annualized revenue).
            </li>
            <li>
              Grew the org from 8 to 18+ people through 4 external hires and absorbing teams in re-orgs.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div
          class="_titleBlock_c6a955"
        >
          <div
            class="_experienceRow_c6a955"
          >
            <span>
