            </span>
            <span
              class="_experienceDates_c6a955"
            >
              03/2022 – 03/2026
            </span>
          </div>
          <ul
            class="_accomplishmentList_c6a955"
          >
            <li>
              Grew the team from 3 to 8 engineers.
            </li>
            <li>
              Extended member accounts from one account per payer to one account across many payers, so ~25% of members keep a single login; retired duplicate authentication systems.
            </li>
            <li>
              Cut eligibility lookup time by 50% by introducing a more reliable caching system.
            </li>
            <li>
              Modernized a legacy system that was causing reputational damage and financial losses, rebuilding it to auto-scale and perform reliably, and cutting support tickets requiring engineering or technical support by ~40%.
            </li>
            <li>
              Led team-wide adoption of Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, and Atlassian Rovo, including custom internal plugins/skills built for team workflows; team consistently met tight delivery deadlines.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div
          class="_titleBlock_c6a955"
        >
          <div
            class="_experienceRow_c6a955"
          >
